sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin as Super Admin
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>platform guards
  participant SaaS as SaaS<br/>onboarding saga
  participant SDB as PostgreSQL<br/>SaaS DB
  participant Contracts as External services<br/>Auth/User/Payment
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>tenant.created
  participant Catalog as Catalog

  Admin->>BFF: POST tenant onboarding
  BFF->>SaaS: ONBOARD command
  SaaS->>SDB: Validate plan and slug<br/>create ACTIVE tenant
  SaaS->>Contracts: Create owner identity<br/>profile + empty payment settings
  Contracts-->>SaaS: ownerUserId and settings ready
  SaaS->>SDB: Save ownerId, subscription<br/>and tenant.created outbox
  SaaS-->>BFF: tenant + ownerUserId
  BFF-->>Admin: Success
  SaaS-->>Kafka: Publish tenant.created
  Kafka-->>Catalog: Create default area if missing

  Note over SaaS,Catalog: tenant.created is an asynchronous side effect<br/>Catalog seeding is idempotent and outside the onboarding commit
